    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/939e52b42e082b617a33b9cbe3e1bf07.poster.avif?t=1627910831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/939e52b42e082b617a33b9cbe3e1bf07.webm?t=1627910831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/939e52b42e082b617a33b9cbe3e1bf07.mp4?t=1627910831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Papa\u2019s Quiz is a party game for 1-8 players. Use phones or tablets as controllers and compete in multiple question types, where the smartest and fastest player will be the last standing victor!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/bab8faf89b10b7473e878a9475675c83.poster.avif?t=1627910831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/bab8faf89b10b7473e878a9475675c83.webm?t=1627910831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/bab8faf89b10b7473e878a9475675c83.mp4?t=1627910831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Create your avatar, and give it a fun name! Dress it up with creative clothes and use it to express your victories in the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/d11afc1f821bd6118b4db6167e8e7f79.poster.avif?t=1627910831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/d11afc1f821bd6118b4db6167e8e7f79.webm?t=1627910831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/d11afc1f821bd6118b4db6167e8e7f79.mp4?t=1627910831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Give the other players a good fight for which category to play.<br>Tap, tap, tap to win! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/4928c4ad030f727a08677d02d4504b5e.poster.avif?t=1627910831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/4928c4ad030f727a08677d02d4504b5e.webm?t=1627910831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484730/extras/4928c4ad030f727a08677d02d4504b5e.mp4?t=1627910831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Choose your dance moves to express your good fortune.",
